sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User B
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as BullMQ Worker

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/devices/:id/revoke
    API->>DB: UPDATE devices SET is_revoked=true
    Worker->>DB: Query pending recipient device records
    DB-->>Worker: Excludes revoked device
    Worker->>Worker: Omit delivery attempt for revoked device
